{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"agent_message","text":"In **ResStock 2025 Release 1**, the advanced air sealing upgrade:\n\n- **Applies to existing homes with baseline leakage ≥6 ACH50**, across all climate zones. New construction and existing homes below 6 ACH50 are excluded.\n- **Reduces leakage to 5 ACH50**—five air changes per hour at a pressure difference of 50 pascals.\n- **Applies to 92.2% of existing dwelling units**; the remaining 7.8% are excluded.\n\nSource: [*ResStock Measure Documentation: Advanced Air Sealing*, p. 1 and Tables 4–5 on p. 5](https://docs.nlr.gov/docs/fy27osti/96738.pdf#page=14)."}}
